From: NixOS sleep lock integration
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve root-managed locking across greeter and release races

Enabled only by settings.sleep.lockSession. Native greeter results cannot
release a root-managed lock. Root-only methods bind release to a freshly
generated, single-use lock token. Every new lock invalidates older authority.
Generic logind Unlock is unversioned and available to the session UID, so this
opt-in build refuses it; ordinary native PAM still works outside managed locks.

